# M5 evidence — block 队列满 busy 判别（2026-11-25）

## 命令

```bash
bash tools/m5_discriminate.sh
```

## 观测

```
[block] busy discriminate ok
[ext4] read /largefile: 204800 bytes
[fs] largefile sha256=d60c9f8a016b8f4ac40ce4dc1813fc70f6bfa21cf47be8bc26ce612413bac594
[m5] PASS
```

## 实现

- `storage_busy_discriminate()`：填满 `BLOCK_PENDING` 后第 5 次 `block_submit` 得 `BLOCK_BUSY`，再排空队列
- `storage_read_path_full()`：bringup 读满 200KiB largefile 并打哈希